# Reference assets both generators check themselves against, and neither needs to
# run. This used to be the `data/cesium-assets` submodule, which everybody had to
# initialise for two checks most people never run; it is a plain optional clone now:
#
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/Flowm/cesium-assets scripts/.reference/cesium-assets
#
# With it present, `pnpm update-imagery` compares its tiles against the tileset it
# replaced and `pnpm update-starmap` checks its faces are the right way round.
# Without it, both say so and skip. Neither check changes what is generated.
*
!.gitignore
